// =============================================================================
// TRADINGVIEW ALERT SETUP
// =============================================================================
//
// 1. After adding the strategy to your chart, click the "..." menu
// 2. Select "Add Alert..."
// 3. Configure:
//    - Condition: Your strategy name
//    - Options: Check "Order fills only" for actual trades
//    - Alert actions: Enable "Webhook URL"
//    - Webhook URL: http://YOUR_SERVER:5000/webhook
//    - Message: Leave empty (it uses alert_message from strategy.entry)
//
// 4. Click "Create"
//
// Now whenever your strategy triggers an entry, TradingView will send
// the JSON payload to your Python bot!
